abstract: >-
  Oxygen isotope composition of phosphate and phosphorus concentration of four sequentially
  extracted (Hedley) fractions in 12 composite soil samples from the R. J. Cook Agronomy Farm
  (Pullman, Washington, USA), with the soil-water oxygen isotope composition and soil temperature
  used to calculate isotopic equilibrium, and the R scripts that reproduce the tables, statistics
  and Figure 3 of the associated article.
